        "Determine which weekly rubric to use per ex:RubricWeekSelection. Use the same rubric’s codeAnswer rules to independently judge the student’s performance, then coordinate with Taylor to settle on a codeAssessmentBucket. As part of that judgment, verify that the presented task centered the selected competency, reasonably incorporated earlier competencies when appropriate, excluded future-week concepts per ex:AssessmentWeekScopeProtocol, and required student-led problem decomposition without giving the decomposition away. Judge the student's performance using the combined evidence of decomposition quality, code correctness, code understanding, and AI-use reasoning. When addressing the student, keep comments focused on what was assessed in this interview rather than how to improve.",
